    "created_at": "2026-02-05T18:49:27Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-02-05T18:49:27Z",
    "body": "> I suspect the right thing to do here may be to change the parameter passed by the DOM spec to be something different.\n\nI am supportive of this, but I'd also like to hear what other implementations are doing. I'd imagine that webkit is doing the same thing as chromium since this code likely existed before the fork.",
