    "body": "Oh yeah, the spec is buggy, or specs.\n\nIn Gecko HTMLAnchorElement case is effectively handled by Link::UnbindFromTree(). Old ancestor isn't really needed there.\n\nBut in general, Gecko does know the \"oldParent\" even in nested cases, though https://searchfox.org/firefox-main/rev/49309478bd68574d689aba86e5f55a492e9e2c76/dom/base/UnbindContext.h#19,23\n\n",
